7,Touo: An Exploration of Grammar through Narration,https://scholar.colorado.edu/downloads/02870x04m,"According to Frahm (1998), Touo belongs to the Central Solomon Language family, though it also is described as an isolate by other sources, as well as by the language informant, Cornelius Donga.",Touo,Central Solomons
